{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-59-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-41-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>張先生和張太表示，自從重建計劃公布以來，他們一直在逐步清貨。眼見清貨工作接近完成，幾個月前決定於7月31日結業。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-14-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-49-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-42-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>舖面接近700平方呎，設有多個高至天花板的書架。張太指，現在很難再找到如此大的空間容納漫畫店的藏書。她說：「這裡不只有最熱門的漫畫作品，一些未必最流行但仍然值得一讀的，我們都有。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-30-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-50-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-54-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>張先生幫客人封箱，並將手推車推上他們的送貨車，他說：「我擔心年輕人不習慣推這些手推車。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/L-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-12-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/M-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-26-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/N-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/O-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-63-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/P-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-43-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Q-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-58-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-34-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/R-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-09-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/S-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-61-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/T-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-66-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>全文報道：彩虹邨重建｜漫畫世界最後一間分店結業；以笑面對起跌，清貨答謝顧客——「總有曲終人散的一天。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T23:29:14.320093+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":22,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}